{
  "description": "A 包，线性递归 deep(n)。两侧的调用深度上限都是 10 000（Node maxCallDepth，Worker stackSizeMb=32；JVM aster-lang-truffle#202 的 MAX_CALL_DEPTH，64 MiB 求值线程；ADR 0063）：deep(9999) 成功，deep(10000) 与 deep(20000) 为 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED / 5（Maximum call depth (10000) exceeded）。平台请求线程是缺省栈，约 1 000 层即溢出：depth-9999 的期望值取自 ts（expect:\"ts\"），depth-10000 不采平台结果。",
  "package": "a-deep-recursion",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "depth-20000",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-deep-recursion",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"n\":20000}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"error\":{\"code\":\"RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\",\"message\":\"evaluation exhausted a resource limit\"},\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"8d5c4728b9db2a9121c25f6524d0f1ef09025547d267ed034cfa36840ccd3510\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"deep\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":false}\n",
      "expectedExit": 5,
      "code": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED"
    },
    {
      "name": "depth-9999",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-deep-recursion",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"n\":9999}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"8d5c4728b9db2a9121c25f6524d0f1ef09025547d267ed034cfa36840ccd3510\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"deep\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":true,\"value\":9999}\n",
      "expectedExit": 0,
      "code": null
    },
    {
      "name": "depth-10000",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-deep-recursion",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"n\":10000}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"error\":{\"code\":\"RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\",\"message\":\"evaluation exhausted a resource limit\"},\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"8d5c4728b9db2a9121c25f6524d0f1ef09025547d267ed034cfa36840ccd3510\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"deep\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":false}\n",
      "expectedExit": 5,
      "code": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED"
    },
    {
      "name": "depth-10",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-deep-recursion",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"n\":10}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"8d5c4728b9db2a9121c25f6524d0f1ef09025547d267ed034cfa36840ccd3510\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"deep\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":true,\"value\":10}\n",
      "expectedExit": 0,
      "code": null
    }
  ]
}
